## Directory Structure
```
Packages/
  Auth/                       ← Domain package (6 products)
  AuthUI/                     ← UI package (2 products)
  TestInfrastructure/         ← Shared test utilities

relux_sample/
  Modules/                    ← App-level modules (not yet extracted)
    App/                      ← Root app module
    Notes/                    ← Notes domain
